[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000700_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000700_02_0010","text":"用水桶\n洗的时候，不是会溶掉嘛"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000700_02_0020","text":"蓝色啊\n绿色啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000700_02_0030","text":"咕噜咕噜\n然后──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000700_02_0040","text":"变成一样的颜色"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000700_02_0050","text":"全部"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000700_02_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000700_02_0060","text":"所以，这个颜色\n是大家混在一起的颜色"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000700_02_0070","text":"──哈哈\n原来如此"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000700_02_0080","text":"大家混在一起的颜色，吗……\n真不错，那个"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000700_02_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000700_02_0090","text":"那就，当成这么回事吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000700_02_0100","text":"呵呵\n耶"}]
